sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Puller (Teams)
    participant D as Drops folder
    participant A as API
    participant W as Worker
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant PR as Projections

    P->>D: write-once source drop<br/>(recording + transcript + metadata.json)
    P->>A: POST /ingests (drop path)
    A->>A: validate drop against JSON Schema
    A->>PG: insert job row
    W->>PG: claim job · mint Meeting row
    W->>W: probe → frames → ocr → screens →<br/>transcribe → align → moments → extract
    Note over W: checkpoint after every stage —<br/>each stage idempotent, restartable
    W->>PG: evidence rows (moments, segments,<br/>screenshots) + derived artifacts
    W->>PR: ingest-complete
    PR->>PR: compute embeddings (1024-dim port)
    PR-->>PG: read evidence
    Note over PR: sole writer projects to<br/>Neo4j + Meilisearch
